# Manual API requests (VS Code REST Client, Rider or Visual Studio).
# Start the app with `aspire run` first.

@Server_HostAddress = http://localhost:5490
@Keycloak_HostAddress = http://localhost:8080

# Value of `Parameters:automation-api-key` from:
#   dotnet user-secrets list --project Prospect.AI.AppHost
@AutomationApiKey = paste-the-key-here

### 1. Get an access token for the development user (dev realm only)
# @name devToken
POST {{Keycloak_HostAddress}}/realms/prospect/protocol/openid-connect/token
Content-Type: application/x-www-form-urlencoded

grant_type=password&client_id=prospect-dev-cli&username=dev@prospect.local&password=dev-password&scope=openid email profile

### 2. Current user (uses the token from request 1)
GET {{Server_HostAddress}}/api/me
Authorization: Bearer {{devToken.response.body.access_token}}
Accept: application/json

### 3. Automation ping, as n8n calls it
GET {{Server_HostAddress}}/api/automation/ping
X-Api-Key: {{AutomationApiKey}}
Accept: application/json

### 4. Create a source for the current user
# @name createSource
POST {{Server_HostAddress}}/api/sources
Authorization: Bearer {{devToken.response.body.access_token}}
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "name": "freelancermap .NET",
  "kind": "Rss",
  "url": "https://www.freelancermap.com/feeds/projects.xml"
}

### 5. List the current user's sources
GET {{Server_HostAddress}}/api/sources
Authorization: Bearer {{devToken.response.body.access_token}}
Accept: application/json

### 6. Deactivate a source (use /activate to turn it back on)
POST {{Server_HostAddress}}/api/sources/{{createSource.response.body.id}}/deactivate
Authorization: Bearer {{devToken.response.body.access_token}}

### 7. Active sources of all users, as workflow A reads them
GET {{Server_HostAddress}}/api/automation/sources
X-Api-Key: {{AutomationApiKey}}
Accept: application/json

### 8. Send collected postings for a source, as workflow A does
POST {{Server_HostAddress}}/api/automation/ingest
X-Api-Key: {{AutomationApiKey}}
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "sourceId": "{{createSource.response.body.id}}",
  "postings": [
    {
      "url": "https://www.example.com/jobs/senior-dotnet-developer?utm_source=rss",
      "title": "Senior .NET developer (remote)",
      "content": "Six-month assignment, C#, ASP.NET Core and Angular, fully remote within the EU.",
      "publishedAt": "2026-10-28T07:00:00Z",
      "companyName": "Example Corp"
    }
  ]
}
